Cell["\<\
Use the expression returned by PauliGellMannAbstract, or construct an \
expression with those same string heads. Ordinary symbols named sigma or \
lambda are not replaced.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1750350826,ExpressionUUID->"44f70ea4-0c93-f042-b22e-060c5cae5927"]
}, Closed]],

